  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "وَما كانَ في هَ عَنْ أَبي ثُمامَةَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And whatever was in it from Abū Thumāmah,"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَدْ رَوَيْتُهُ عَنْ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ ماجِيلُوَيْهِ؛ وَمُحَمَّدِ بْنِ مُوسى بْنِ الْمُتَوَكِّلِ؛ وَالْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ إِبْراهِيمَ ـ رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُمْ ـ عَنْ عَلِيِّ بْنِ إِبْراهِيمَ بْنِ هاشِمٍ، عَنْ أَبِيهِ، عَنْ أَبي ثُمامَةَ صاحِبِ أَبي جَعْفَرٍ الثّانِي عَلَيْهِ السَّلامُ."
      "translations": {
        "en": "I have narrated it from Muḥammad ibn ʿAlī Mājīlawayh, and Muḥammad ibn Mūsā ibn al-Mutawakkil, and al-Ḥusayn ibn Ibrāhīm—may Allah be pleased with them—from ʿAlī ibn Ibrāhīm ibn Hāshim, from his father, from Abū Thumāmah, the companion of Abū Jaʿfar al-Thānī عليه السلام."
      }
    }
  ],
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "This passage records the sanad/isnad through which the author transmits reports from Abū Thumāmah. It serves as a chain-clarification entry in Man lā yaḥḍuruhu al-Faqīh, identifying the intermediaries linking the compiler to a companion of Abū Jaʿfar al-Thānī عليه السلام.",
      "seo_question": "What is the transmission chain to Abū Thumāmah in Man lā yaḥḍuruhu al-Faqīh?",
      "key_terms": {
        "أَبي ثُمامَةَ": "Abū Thumāmah, the narrator from whom reports are transmitted here",
        "رَوَيْتُهُ": "I narrated it; a transmission formula indicating reception and reporting",
        "صاحِبِ أَبي جَعْفَرٍ الثّانِي": "the companion of Abū Jaʿfar al-Thānī عليه السلام"
      }
    }
  },
